  "scope": "A single decision with a supplied 39-world finite model. Stats, items, sleep time and remaining roster are fixed to the replay; this is not the full legal information set. Uniform is a model control, not an estimated real-world prior. Robust uses independent simultaneous Exp3-IX draws for our first action and the adversary world/reply, with shared own continuation histories and the existing search/evaluator afterwards. No convergence guarantee is claimed for the nonstationary continuation search. best is a most-visited pure choice, not the empirical mixed policy. Certificate bounds score only the recorded first choice/distribution: the lower uses the archived shared Rock Slide continuation (zero bound for other openings); the upper allows optimal later play. Neither certifies the prototype continuation or repeated replanning. The 500ms native Mac budget includes belief construction, search initialization and all iterations; file loading and the supplied-world replay/verification are outside that budget. No iPad performance or whole-battle improvement claim."
